# Date: 2026-09-09
# Purpose: prove the current bridge before changing Date/storage logic again.
# The preserved 2026-09-08 `.toISOString()` failure predates current editor-domain.ts.
# Current source already revives createdAt/updatedAt via nativeProject() before storage/restore.
# Therefore this patch adds evidence, not another broad Date coercion patch.
